  "name": "Brazilian Fish Stew",
  "subtitle": "Coconut fish stew with spiced vegetables and lime",
  "description": "Tender sea bass simmers in a paprika- and cumin-seasoned coconut broth with peppers, onion, cilantro, and lime. Serve over soy-seasoned rice.",
